        "id": 46528,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-01T20:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Unsafe_Bet\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/u/53a042/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Unsafe_Bet:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>and incapacitated heroes no longer have cards in hand</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This isn't quite true. Incapped hero don't have a hand at all, not a hand of 0. I think this hints at what the real answer is that it is all active heroes. Incapped heroes don't have hands or powers, both are abilities directly relevant to the card in question. The card doesn't apply to an incapped hero (it doesn't have powers or a hand), and only the active heroes have to discard.</p>\n<p>EDIT: This is how it works on the Mea Computer.</p>",
