        "id": 46531,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-01T21:13:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Mega Computer is the card rules and interaction engine for the upcoming video game of the card game.</p><p>The intent of the Mega Computer is to accurately play any situation according to rules, and the makers have worked a lot with GtG to make sure it lives up to their goal.</p><p><span>If Mega-Computer plays it that way it probably should be played that way.</span></p><p>The game does a good job of avoiding those kind of lockdowns, I doubt that Paparazzi is intended to work that way.</p>",
