      {
        "id": 46536,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-02T00:24:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>True, I didn't say this is true, but rather what the Mega Computer does right now. When they setup the game, they sat down with GtG and said, \"Ok, tell me&nbsp;<em>exactly</em> how this thing works.\" There are a few things not perfect, but that is why it is in testing. Right now, the Mega Computer will destroy the card if all active players discard a card. While I can see how this might not work for the wording (I can also see how it doesn't), I just can't picture this being true. Also, there are a bunch of cards that would fall into this category.</p><p>MigrantP did say he will post the some of the rules, especially regarding how to handle multiple effects and modifiers.</p>",
